  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <code>EntityManagerBeanDefinitionRegistrarPostProcessor</code> allowing to filter which\n<code>EntityManagerFactory</code> beans should be decorated with a <code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 `<code>EntityManagerBeanDefinitionRegistrarPostProcessor</code>`，允许筛选哪些 `<code>EntityManagerFactory`  Bean 应该使用 `<code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code>` 进行装饰。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a> to register a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/SharedEntityManagerCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code></a> for every\n<code>EntityManagerFactory</code> bean definition found in the application context to enable autowiring\n<code>EntityManager</code> instances into constructor arguments. Adds the <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> bean name as\nqualifier to the <code>EntityManager</code> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> to enable explicit references in case of multiple\n<code>EntityManagerFactory</code> instances.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.config 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a> 用于为应用程序上下文中找到的每个 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> Bean 定义注册一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/SharedEntityManagerCreator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.orm.jpa 中的类或接口\"><code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code></a>，以支持将 <code>EntityManager</code> 实例自动注入到构造函数参数中。此外，它还将 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> Bean 名称作为限定符添加到 <code>EntityManager</code> <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.config 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> 中，以便在存在多个 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> 实例时支持显式引用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "since 4.0, in favor of using either <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/AbstractEntityManagerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>AbstractEntityManagerFactoryBean</code></a>\n            that provides a shared <code>EntityManager</code> or using <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/SharedEntityManagerCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code></a> directly in your\n            configuration.",
      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，建议使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/AbstractEntityManagerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>AbstractEntityManagerFactoryBean</code></a>` 来提供共享的 `<code>EntityManager</code>`，或者直接在配置中使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/orm/jpa/SharedEntityManagerCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>decoratorPredicate</code> - the predicate to determine whether a given named <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> should be\n         decorated with a <code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>decoratorPredicate</code> - 用于确定是否应使用 <code>SharedEntityManagerCreator</code> 装饰给定命名 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.config 中的类或接口\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> 的谓词。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html#getOrder()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\">getOrder</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\">Ordered</a></code>",
      "translation": "`getOrder` 在接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/Ordered.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\">Ordered</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">postProcessBeanFactory</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code>",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html#postProcessBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.config.ConfigurableListableBeanFactory)\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">postProcessBeanFactory</a></code> 在接口 <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.beans.factory.config\">BeanFactoryPostProcessor</a></code> 中",
